Heavily weigh the analysis of Goldman Sachs research reports. The conviction scores is set entirely by Goldman Sachs research activity; a flurry of activity raises the conviction score and a dormant period lowers it. Read through Goldman Sachs economic forecasts in their investor portal and their company ratings. If Goldman Sachs signals strong earnings reports, and the S&P 500 index is weighted towards the companies Goldman Sachs says will report favorably, give a positive sentiment.